cility.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you visit a chocolate factory.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to roast", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to cook food in an oven or over a fire", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We roast the cocoa beans in our factory.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to clean", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to rub and wash ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You must clean the beans before you can roast them.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to shell", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take off the hard, outer part of a bean", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We shell the beans before we roast them.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bitter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not sweet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Cocoa beans are bitter before they become chocolate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cocoa", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a bean used to make chocolate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Cocoa beans grow in tropical countries.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to heat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make something hot", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We heat the beans and add sugar to make a paste.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to grind", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to crush something into powder", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We grind the beans to make cocoa powder.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "paste", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sticky thick mixture", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We heat and grind the beans to produce a thick, dark paste.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mold", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a container used to give shape to hot material when it cools down", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We pour the chocolate paste into molds.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Directions in a Building", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use wh- questions to ask for directions in a building.<br />You can use the<span class =\"strong\"> Simple Present</span>, the <span class =\"strong\">Imperative</span>, expressions and prepositions of place, to give directions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Directions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Giving Directions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where is \u2026 ?<br /> How do I get to \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Go straight ahead/right next door ...<br /> Turn right/left ....<br /> Walk down the hall ...<br /> Take the stairs ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: Where is the packaging room?<br /> <span class =\"strong\">Guide</span>: Walk straight ahead. It's down the hall.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: Where is the gift shop?<br /> <span class =\"strong\">Guide</span>: The gift shop is right beside the exit!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of something you love to eat.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online and research the steps involved in making it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5-8 steps.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the steps aloud to your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I research on a recipe to make food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write instructions on how to make food.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn4le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Steve</span>: Good morning! Welcome to our factory tour. My name is Steve and I am here to tell you how we make our world-famous chocolate.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This is exciting! Where do we begin?<br />"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob09re2img02.jpg", "time"